<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6927" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναλογ-ίζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reckon up, sum up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὡμολογημένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					332d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				330e
			</span></i>: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν προειρημένων
			ἀ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				524d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δεινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.1.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Heb.</u>
				12.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ γεγονότα καὶ τὰ παρόντα πρὸς
				τὰ μέλλοντα ἀ.</span>
			<i>calculate</i> the past and the present <i>in comparison
			with</i> the future, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				186a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1320b20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τούτων ἀ.</span>
			<i>make calculations</i> from . . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				293a33
			</span></i>; <i>infer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				14.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.Oen.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				38
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>calculate, consider,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				14.47
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> foll. by a
			Conjunction, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὡς</span> . .
				<i>calculate</i> or <i>reflect</i> that, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.83
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.4.23
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>take into account,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1251.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>recapitulate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Phil.</u>
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
